    "desc": "Displays encounter acceptance rate trending, accepted encounters claims paid amount volume, and processed claim paid amount volume per quarter. \n•\tPlacing the mouse over an encounter will display the volume for that encounter per quarter. \n•\tTo view information for a specific quarter, select the desired encounter on the widget. The widgets will adjust to reflect information for that specific encounter and quarter only. Utilizing filter features will only affect that user’s view.\n•\tTo filter all corresponding widgets by grouped selection, left click and drag across the desired information. Click select. All correlating widgets will adjust.\n•\tTo clear the filter from a widget, select clear selection. To restore the work session dashboard and clear any filters, select the options icon located at the top right corner of the dialog. Select Restore Dashboard. \nEncounters: (Accepted, Rejected, No Response)",
